So, for the given vectors $\begin{pmatrix} 5 \\ 2 \\ -6 \end{pmatrix}$ and $\begin{pmatrix} 1 \\ 1 \\ 3 \end{pmatrix}$, the cross product is $\begin{pmatrix} (2)(3)-(-6)(1) \\ (-6)(1)-(5)(3) \\ (5)(1)-(2)(1) \end{pmatrix} = \begin{pmatrix} 12 \\ -21 \\ 3 \end{pmatrix}$.
